 this type of mission the  first people who go to Mars should go  with the expectation that they might  never come back but that hasn't stopped  explorers for centuries there's always  going to be a drive in humans  to go places we've never been before and  for the most part that drive is  something that has aided our survival at  times so will the risks on a trip to  Mars be great  absolutely should we go absolutely
 

